import{_ as a,o as t,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 732 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Douluo's Tang San: The Closed Parasitism of the God Realm","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 732 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Douluo's Tang San: The Closed Parasitism of the God Realm","no":732,"module":4,"tags":["Critique of Hang-Up Retirement","Douluo Continent","Tang San","God Realm","Closed Parasitism"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","47-Anti-Monopoly Law","05-Myriad-Rank Co-Advancement Basic Platform"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0732_模块4-斗罗唐三神界的封闭寄生.md","filePath":"en/0732_模块4-斗罗唐三神界的封闭寄生.md"}`),n={name:"en/0732_模块4-斗罗唐三神界的封闭寄生.md"};function s(l,e,r,h,u,d){return t(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-732-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-douluo-s-tang-san-the-closed-parasitism-of-the-god-realm" tabindex="-1">Entry 732 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Douluo&#39;s Tang San: The Closed Parasitism of the God Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-732-critique-of-hang-up-retirement-douluo-s-tang-san-the-closed-parasitism-of-the-god-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 732 | Critique of Hang-Up Retirement | Douluo&#39;s Tang San: The Closed Parasitism of the God Realm&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 47, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-most-exquisite-closed-farm" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the most exquisite closed farm <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-most-exquisite-closed-farm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the most exquisite closed farm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If Ye Fan&#39;s hang-up is &quot;the strong one lonely at the heights,&quot; and Shi Hao&#39;s hang-up is &quot;tragically bearing it alone,&quot; then Tang San&#39;s God Realm is a more concealed, also more exquisite, kind of hang-up — <strong>a closed parasitic farm.</strong> By the Douluo series&#39; Tales of the God Realm and Tang Clan Hero Legend, the God Realm has become the protagonist group and their descendants&#39; private manor; beings of the mortal realm (Douluo Star) are locked beneath the God Realm, never climbing up. This is not transcendence; this is turning the entire civilization into the God Realm&#39;s nourishment farm.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry act as the critique ruler: the anti-predation axiom is directly this critique&#39;s parent law; the republican axiom of Myriad Races asks on what basis the God Realm monopolizes the uplift channel; the collective ascension axiom points out the mortal realm is locked; the causal self-discipline axiom examines the God Realm&#39;s intervention on the mortal realm; the law-first axiom examines the Douluo system&#39;s book-eating/ending history.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-heng-yuan-zhou-s-judgment-of-tang-san-s-god-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Judgment of Tang San&#39;s God Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-heng-yuan-zhou-s-judgment-of-tang-san-s-god-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Judgment of Tang San&#39;s God Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-closedness-a-one-way-valve-between-mortal-realm-and-god-realm" tabindex="-1">1.1 Closedness: A One-Way Valve Between Mortal Realm and God Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-closedness-a-one-way-valve-between-mortal-realm-and-god-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Closedness: A One-Way Valve Between Mortal Realm and God Realm&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Douluo system&#39;s God Realm is a closed structure:</p><ul><li>Mortal-realm cultivators wanting to become gods must pass the God Realm&#39;s selection;</li><li>Selection standards are decided by existing gods in the God Realm;</li><li>Divine positions are limited; old gods do not abdicate; new gods cannot rise;</li><li>Once a God-Realm god becomes a god, he permanently dwells in the God Realm, decoupled from the mortal realm.</li></ul><p>This is a <strong>one-way valve</strong>: the mortal realm may only send upward; the God Realm does not feed downward. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Origin two-way cycle is here cut into one-way extraction.</p><h3 id="_1-2-parasitism-the-god-realm-is-nourished-by-the-mortal-realm" tabindex="-1">1.2 Parasitism: The God Realm Is Nourished by the Mortal Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-parasitism-the-god-realm-is-nourished-by-the-mortal-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Parasitism: The God Realm Is Nourished by the Mortal Realm&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The God Realm&#39;s gods are not self-supporting. Their power, divine positions, and status are all built on the mortal realm&#39;s billions of beings&#39; faith, cultivation, and sacrifice. The harder mortal-realm beings cultivate, the stronger the God Realm; but mortal-realm beings are forever locked under the ceiling of &quot;cannot become a god.&quot;</p><p>This is the parasitism discussed in Entry 728: <strong>the God Realm is the host; the mortal realm is the crop.</strong> The crop is harvested when ripe; after harvest, it is planted again.</p><h3 id="_1-3-protagonist-uniqueness-dependency-high" tabindex="-1">1.3 Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency &quot;High&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-protagonist-uniqueness-dependency-high" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency &quot;High&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Per Glossary Article 50, the Douluo system&#39;s protagonist-uniqueness dependency rating is &quot;high&quot; (gift-style). Tang San, from being a two-lives person, cheats all the way, finally establishing the God Realm order. The entire God Realm revolves around the Tang family and around Tang San&#39;s will. No matter how many mortal-realm cultivators there are, they are only the God Realm&#39;s backdrop.</p><h2 id="ii-the-douluo-system-s-book-eating-ending-history" tabindex="-1">II. The Douluo System&#39;s Book-Eating/Ending History <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-douluo-system-s-book-eating-ending-history" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Douluo System&#39;s Book-Eating/Ending History&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Douluo system is the law-first axiom&#39;s most typical negative example:</p><ul><li>The first Douluo Continent&#39;s realm setting is constantly expanded in the second Peerless Tang Sect;</li><li>The third Legend of the Dragon King and fourth Ultimate Douluo completely lose control of the combat-power ruler;</li><li>The God Realm setting goes from nothing to something, from something to changed; each time it is temporarily adjusted for plot needs;</li><li>Tang San&#39;s setting, from &quot;transmigrator&quot; to &quot;God Realm enforcer&quot; to &quot;creation-level entity,&quot; eats its own books all the way.</li></ul><p>This is the textbook case of Glossary Article 48&#39;s &quot;book-eating/ending risk.&quot; The law-first axiom requires &quot;never eat a book, never end in failure&quot;; the Douluo system does the opposite — for plot convenience, it overturns its own setting again and again.</p><h2 id="iii-what-happens-if-tang-san-enters-heng-yuan-zhou" tabindex="-1">III. What Happens If Tang San Enters Heng Yuan Zhou <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-what-happens-if-tang-san-enters-heng-yuan-zhou" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. What Happens If Tang San Enters Heng Yuan Zhou&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou does not deny Tang San&#39;s personal ability. If Tang San were placed into Heng Yuan Zhou:</p><ul><li>His destructive-power score would be extremely high;</li><li>But the &quot;God Realm&quot; structure he established violates the republican axiom of Myriad Races — on what basis do a few families monopolize divine positions?</li><li>His extraction of the mortal realm violates the anti-predation axiom — is the mortal realm a crop?</li><li>His repeatedly changing setting violates the law-first axiom — the Douluo system itself cannot pass the setting-self-consistency check;</li><li>He would be reformed: either open the divine-position channel to Myriad Ranks and transform the God Realm into a nine-post-style public post, or be stripped of &quot;divine-position monopoly,&quot; with the uplift channel taken over by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision.</li></ul><p>Tang San in Heng Yuan Zhou would not be negated as a bad person, but the structure he established must be reformed.</p><h2 id="iv-the-douluo-system-s-pollution-of-real-world-values" tabindex="-1">IV. The Douluo System&#39;s Pollution of Real-World Values <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-douluo-system-s-pollution-of-real-world-values" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Douluo System&#39;s Pollution of Real-World Values&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Douluo system influenced a whole generation of readers. The values it transmits:</p><ul><li>The protagonist cheating is reasonable (two lives, Clear Sky Hammer twin spirits);</li><li>The uplift channel is limited (limited divine positions);</li><li>Those at the top monopolizing top positions is normal (God Realm eternal);</li><li>Mortal-realm people cultivating hard is mainly for the chance to be chosen by those at the top.</li></ul><p>This set of values seeping into reality is one of the cultural roots of &quot;class solidification is natural.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou Library&#39;s Module 4 opposes this set of values at the law level — <strong>the uplift channel must cover 99%; the top must be open to all beings.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: mortal-realm billions&#39; cultivation results are one-way-extracted by the God Realm; this is civilization-grade waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Douluo God Realm is the textbook sample of parasitic predation; Heng Yuan Zhou structurally prevents this ecology</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo is itself one of the critique targets; its protagonist-uniqueness dependency is &quot;high&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s networked transcendence is &quot;extremely low&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Douluo God Realm&#39;s divine positions are only open to a few chosen ones; Heng Yuan Zhou requires 99% of clans have roads</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the Douluo God Realm&#39;s manuals and law understanding only circulate within the God Realm; Heng Yuan Zhou requires the Selfless Dao be public across the whole network</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang San&#39;s God Realm is web-novel hang-up retirement&#39;s most exquisite, also most harmful, kind. It does not manifest as loneliness, does not manifest as tragedy, it manifests as &quot;orderly&quot; — but this order&#39;s essence is closed parasitism. Mortal-realm beings are locked in this order; God Realm gods hang up in this order. <strong>What Heng Yuan Zhou must do is tear off this one-way valve and replace it with the two-way channel of the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/47-反垄断法.html">Entry 47 · Anti-Monopoly Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Rank Co-Advancement Basic Platform</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">Entry 97 · Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const g=a(n,[["render",s]]);export{c as __pageData,g as default};
